  "CL_SQL_STATEMENT==============CP
  "EXECUTE_QUERY (CL_SQL_STATEMENT)

*->2024-09-19 11:47:09.000  {A:initial} 0 00
*->9999-12-30 23:59:59.000  {A:initial} 0 00

  DATA lv_timestamp TYPE string.

  CONVERT DATE sy-datum TIME sy-uzeit
    DAYLIGHT SAVING TIME sy-dayst
    INTO TIME STAMP DATA(lv_curr_ts) TIME ZONE sy-zonlo.

  CONVERT TIME STAMP lv_curr_ts
  TIME ZONE 'UTC' INTO
    DATE DATA(lv_sydatum)
    TIME DATA(lv_syuzeit).

  lv_syuzeit = lv_syuzeit - 3600.

  lv_timestamp = |{ lv_sydatum DATE = ISO } { lv_syuzeit TIME = ISO }.000|.
  ls_param_tab-data_ref = REF #( lv_timestamp ).
  APPEND ls_param_tab TO  lt_param_tab.


